Complete DSA Learning Order (Step by Step)->

PHASE 0: Language + Time/Space Complexity (✅ Done)
│
├── PHASE 1: Basic DS (Array, String, ArrayList, HashMap)
│       └── Problems: 15-20 Easy (LeetCode)
│
├── PHASE 2: Searching & Sorting
│       └── Linear/Binary Search → Recursion → Merge/Quick Sort
│
├── PHASE 3: Optimization Techniques (🔥 Yahaan Two Pointers, Sliding Window)
│       └── Two Pointers, Sliding Window, Prefix Sum, Kadane's
│
├── PHASE 4: Linked List
│       └── Singly/Doubly (Reversal, Slow-Fast, Merge List)
│
├── PHASE 5: Stack & Queue
│       └── Monotonic Stack, Sliding Window with Deque
│
├── PHASE 6: Tree
│       └── Binary Tree → BST → Complete/Balanced Tree
│
├── PHASE 7: Recursion & Backtracking (Phir se deep dive)
│
├── PHASE 8: Dynamic Programming (DP)
│       └── 1D → 2D → Knapsack Pattern → LCS Pattern → MCM Pattern
│
├── PHASE 9: Graph
│       └── BFS → DFS → Dijkstra → MST → Union Find → Topo Sort
│
└── PHASE 10: Advanced (Optional but good)
        └── Bit Manipulation, Tries, Segment Tree, Intervals